WEBVTT

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.050
That was good!

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:07.110
Yeah!

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.580
I'm back!

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:12.070
Welcome back! Could you go pick up three packs of shimeji?

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:13.910
Capisce.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.900
Huh? A new shop?

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:26.150
This is the first new business since the opening of that big supermarket, right?

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:29.070
No wonder, the whole district lost so many customers after that.

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:37.150
I knew something was coming, but I didn't expect a whole new store.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.560
Okonomiyaki Ninja-Monja.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.250
So it's an okonomiyaki place.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.770
We're opening tomorrow, so you better be there.

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:46.330
Hello.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:48.080
Dorothy and Leona?

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:48.520
Why?

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:50.980
This is where we live.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.490
Eh, really?

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:57.450
We moved in a bit early, but we're finally ready to open.

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.950
Your parents run Papa's Pasta, right?

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:01.120
Uh, yeah.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:05.950
Well sorry, but we'll be taking every customer in the district!

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:07.250
Prepare to be bankrupted!

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:10.000
Ca-Capisce...

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:49.500
Tasty Hiroshima style okonomiyaki.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:53.920
The whole menu at half price for the first month.

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:57.330
Seems we have a serious new competi-tortilla.

00:02:57.330 --> 00:03:00.110
They're really going to get our business like this.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.670
Let's do some marketing for our place too!

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:05.830
Tomorrow's Sunday, so I can shout to call customers all day!

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:08.340
How about making some discount coupons to give out too?

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:11.710
Good idea. How about we go half-price too?

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:12.790
Yeah! Let's do it!

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:17.760
Alright! Tomorrow we'll all work our buns off!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:17.770
Capisce!

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:19.010
Okay!
Capisce!

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.970
Ehh?!

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:24.430
You snapped Friend Tickets with SoLaMi SMILE's Sophie?

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.460
Yeah.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:26.510
When?

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:30.640
Back when we beat them for the first time.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:31.970
Why?

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:38.360
She gave me a hint for the Making Drama, and somehow she's really easy to talk to.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:42.070
And Mireille seems really trustworthy.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:45.030
And I wish I could be as openly cheerful as Lala...

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:47.830
Why are you so eager to praise them?

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:48.350
Eh?

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:51.170
Who do you like more? Me or them?

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:53.960
W-Well, of course I like you more, but...

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:57.600
I wish I could be friends with them too.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.660
No, no, no!

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:02.700
I don't wanna hear you praise anyone else! No, no, no! No way! I'm not listening!

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:07.630
S-Sorry... I still think you're the best, Dorothy.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:09.080
Right?!

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:12.460
Tomorrow we're running Lala's shop out of business!

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.190
Let's give 'em what for, Leona!

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:17.720
Yeah. If you say so, Dorothy...

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:23.570
Come dine at Ninja-Monja!

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.850
I'll be sad if you don't.

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:31.310
Here. Please come around if you'd like to.

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:34.440
Hey, aren't those the idol twins, Dorothy and Leona?

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.500
They are! They're so cute!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.370
Wow, Dorothy and Leona!

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:39.730
You're from Dressing Pafé, right?

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:40.920
Where's Shion?

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.260
This is amazing!

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:46.070
The whole menu's half price at Papa's Pasta!

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:47.880
Come dine with us!

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.470
Come get some coupons!

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:52.050
Whoa, what a crowd.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:53.590
I gotta work harder!

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:56.190
Come get your coupons for Papa's Pasta!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:57.480
Here you go!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.400
First come first serve!

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:01.300
Shion? Why are you here?

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.940
Dorothy asked for my help.

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:07.370
I can't very well ignore a teammate's request.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:11.340
I have no quarrel with Papa's Pasta,
but it's the law of the jungle out here!

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:12.790
Expect no mercy.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.830
Dine at Ninja-Monja, people!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.310
It's Toudou Shion! She's so cool!

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:20.760
Let's <i>go!</i>

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:21.960
Seriously?

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:25.550
Hey, hey, let's go, Ninja! Let's go, Monja!

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:27.810
Oh yeah!

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:29.160
Tension Max!

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:30.370
Relax.

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:31.470
Dorothy and...

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:32.380
Leona!

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:33.770
Here we are!

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:35.390
Whoa!

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:36.520
They're so cute!

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:41.730
<i>You're hopeless against me and Leona.</i>

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:48.610
Dorothy, Leona and Shion all already have a bunch of fans gathered up!

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:51.520
They're taking all our customers!

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:55.040
Well, you've got no idol presence outside PriPara.

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.710
Help me out, Minami!

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:03.350
Sophie!

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.800
Okay. I get the situation.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:12.880
Leave it to me. With my calculations,
Papa's Pasta has a 200% chance of victory!

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:14.720
Really? What should we do?

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:21.100
Plan #1: Start by using Sophie's idol appeal to draw customers in!

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:22.000
Me?

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.550
Yes. We're counting on you too, Royal Guard.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:26.370
Roger!

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:27.190
Chanko!

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:31.430
Look! It's Lady Sophie, from SoLaMi SMILE!

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:34.300
So it is-chanko! And she looks particularly radiant today-chanko!

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:35.490
They said Sophie's there!

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:37.180
The idol?

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:39.060
Sophie, can I shake your hand?

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.200
I like your new style in SoLaMi SMILE!

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:45.440
Yeah, I love the new cuter Sophie!

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.420
Really? Thank you.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:51.890
Lady Sophie is a big fan of Papa's Pasta's pizza! It's really great stuff!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:53.390
Half off-chanko!

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:55.760
Things should be under control for a while.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:58.170
Amazing! Sophie is so amazing!

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:01.140
We're just getting started! Time for plan #2!

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:02.060
What's that?

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:05.310
If you want to win, know your enemy.

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:06.780
We're doing reconnaissance.

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.530
Capisce!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.740
Wow, it's packed!

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:17.660
Their marketing is clearly working.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.040
N-Ninja?

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.500
Welcome to our humble establishment!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.500
Table for two?

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.550
N-Ninja?

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:28.600
Why?

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:32.430
I run this establishment along with my ninja studies.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:36.050
Monja made by ninja! Ninja-Monja!

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:38.710
Are you... Dorothy and Leona's father?

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:44.300
Oh! Thou art friends of Dorothy and Leona! As true as my name is West!

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:46.850
Two customers coming through!

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:50.950
Hiroshima style okonomiyaki, coming right up!

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.400
So you're Dorothy and Leona's friends?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.410
I hope you'll keep being good friends.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:57.730
Of course!

00:07:57.730 --> 00:07:59.640
<i>Their mom seems nice.</i>

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:04.000
The trick to proper Hiroshima style okonomiyaki is having lots of cabbage!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.380
Fry it up like so and...

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:09.420
Crack an egg, cook for a while...

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.760
Then top it off and we're done!

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.300
There! How's that?

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.910
Looks great! Can I eat it now?

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.470
Not so fast!

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:24.560
It's all in the timing! We've a while to go yet.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:25.440
Okay.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:27.770
Here!

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:35.740
This is great!

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.720
We're out of fliers, do you have more?

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:41.450
Sure do! Good work out there!

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:45.330
Oh. A true warrior.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:49.520
Don't try this at home!

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:52.870
Magnificent! Art thou a Samurai?

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:54.470
I am an idol!

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:59.970
Hark! Yon spatula was in truth harmless plastic.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:03.080
Mom, I need more fliers too!

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:04.100
Sure thing!

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:07.860
Huh? SoLaMi SMILE? What are you doing here?

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:14.040
Dorothy! Your efforts have us in great favor of the customers! As true as my name is West!

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.840
Don't thank me, Dad.

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:19.640
Our rivals are just too weak.

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.570
Gosh darn it!

00:09:24.570 --> 00:09:27.450
But make no mistake, they're a formidable adversary.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.440
That okonomiyaki was great.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.590
Yeah. Amazingly good.

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:34.910
Seems we'll have to get serious about this.

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:38.050
Time for plan #3: The Big Catch!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.750
Big catch?

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:47.730
Basically we need to find a person whose patronage will draw other customers in, and drag them into the store!

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:51.630
Places where celebrities go tend to get more popular, right?

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:52.620
I see.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:54.110
But who could we get?

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:57.960
What wonderful weather for lunch time!

00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:00.830
What pasta shall I have today?

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:04.540
It seems unusual crowded today...

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.810
Oh, I see...

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:09.310
Let's go, Leona!

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:10.220
Right!

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:12.640
Come on in, Headmistress!

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:14.230
The freshly baked pizza is waiting!

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:16.290
Headmistress Ookanda!

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:18.730
Our new Okonomiyaki restaurant just opened today!

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:20.310
It's really good, come try it out!

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:25.520
Okonomiyaki? That might be good for a change.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.650
Right? Let's get going!

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:30.060
No! You want pizza, Headmistress!

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:31.150
Okonomiyaki!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.160
Pizza!

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:33.700
Okonomiyaki!

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.150
Settle down!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:39.910
Right, let's have the Headmistress judge which one is better!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.620
Sounds good! We won't lose!

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:56.720
What's this?

00:10:57.990 --> 00:10:59.510
First move is ours!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.260
Here, our famous special okonomiyaki!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.410
Here, isn't it easier with this?

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:09.940
How considerate.

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:18.070
Well, okonomiyaki might be fine, but does it really stand a chance against the pizza from Papa's Pasta—

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.690
What is this fragrant scent in the sauce?

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:23.160
Most fascinating.

00:11:28.940 --> 00:11:31.520
Delicious!

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:34.350
This combination of crisp cabbage and juice pork...

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:37.480
This gently fried egg is art! And the luster of these noodles!

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:41.560
What an exquisite balance! Simply magnificent!

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:45.340
Lala!

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.220
Right!

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:49.990
Here! Papa's Pasta's specialty: The Mix Pizza!

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.340
This! This is it!

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:54.940
The rich fragrance never fails to impress!

00:11:57.450 --> 00:11:59.150
Simply wonderful!

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:05.120
The mild cheese wrapping the intense flavor of tomato in a warm, sticky embrace!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:09.770
And the olive oil seeping through it all!

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:11.640
A true masterpiece!

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:14.500
Hooray!

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.840
Oh? Not bad at all.

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.680
But just you wait!

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:23.150
Darling! We need <i>that!</i>

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:24.890
Very well, acknowledged!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.090
Here! Our special Ninja-Monja!

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:30.100
Go on, eat up!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.310
I can sense the passion gone into this dish.

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.370
This is...

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:42.850
It's far beyond my imagination!
A veritable dance hall of flavors!

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:46.070
The ingredients are dancing a passionate tango in my mouth!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:50.160
Singing in a most delectable harmony!

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.990
What a revolutionary taste!

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:54.120
Thank you.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.360
We can't lose to that!

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:57.110
Yeah.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:12:59.550
Papa!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.580
Leave it to me-nestrone!

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.680
Here you go.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:11.000
The seafood-mountain harvest pasta of overflowing happiness.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.440
Overflowing happiness?

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:20.780
What an unbelievable flavor!

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:27.090
The varied fruit of the sea and mountains alike, polished to a shine like jewels...

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:31.990
The satisfaction of a summer festival and New Year's in one day!

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:34.870
It is the most wonderful feeling!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.960
I'm so happy you're pleased with it.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.160
Mom, bring on more stuff!

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:40.420
Gotcha!

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:41.920
Let's keep it up, Mom!

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:42.700
Yes!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:44.840
Here you go!

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:47.110
And here!

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:49.820
Delicious! Absolutely delicious!

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:52.560
I could keep eating forever!

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:54.770
It's an even competiton...

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:59.980
They're neck in neck. Neither side is giving an inch. Magnificent.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:00.990
That looks great!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:03.440
I want some too!

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:07.060
Everyone's getting interested now!

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:07.860
Okay!

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:13.090
Here you go! Have some, if you'd please.

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:14.260
Here!

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:16.310
Here you go!

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:20.580
Here! It's really good! Here you go!

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:22.710
Wow, this is great!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.050
Try this one too!

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.810
Here you go!

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:31.880
It's really good!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.350
What's going on?

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:35.950
A gourmet battle?

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:36.930
That looks good!

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:40.190
Whoa, the crowd got huge!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:44.390
Seems everyone was drawn to your passionate competition.

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:48.840
It's been a while since it was this busy around here.

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:51.810
Reminds me of times before that big supermarket opened.

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:52.910
It's so nice.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:55.830
If we had the business we had then...

00:14:55.830 --> 00:15:01.580
I see. We need to advertise more so people keep coming here!

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:04.350
Minami, help me out?

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:05.300
Eh?

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:07.760
I'm thirsty after that pizza.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:13.760
Capisce! Parajuku Parlor's freshly squeezed orange juice is really great!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.810
Oh? Maybe we should drop by there.

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:19.160
I want some dessert now.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:23.330
Parajuku-dou's dumplings go easy on the sweetness, and make for great souvenirs too!

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.520
Oh, really?

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:28.670
Having my full stomach sure makes me sleepy.

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:33.110
Parajuku bedding store's down futons are super fluffy for great dreams!

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.990
Oh, good to know.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:37.200
Don't forget the candy store, Yabage!

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:39.910
This shoe store has repair services too.

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:41.820
Doggies.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:46.750
It's like the whole district is waking up.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:50.330
I see. Increasing traffic in the whole district...

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.590
Not bad at all!

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.800
Here you go, and here, and you too!

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:57.950
<i>Once Lala got moving, she instantly inspired smiles in everyone.</i>

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:02.270
<i>She might actually have the strongest idol presence among us...</i>

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.980
Having friends is nice, isn't it?

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.590
I hope they never drift apart.

00:16:12.390 --> 00:16:14.390
Friends are just a bunch of needless hassle.

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:15.000
What?

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.330
Uh, err...

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.680
Having friends who understand you is truly wonderful.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:26.620
I always hoped Lala would grow up to appreciate her friends most of all.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:31.040
I think friends are the most valuable thing in the world.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:34.840
Being able to trust your friends is the most wonderful...

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:39.900
No! Friends always betray each other in the end!

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:44.810
Clearly we have a disagreement.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.180
Excuse me!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.280
You're really amazing, Lala!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:51.910
I suppose we'll have to call it a draw today.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:53.810
You're just exaggerating!

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:54.950
Not so fast!

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:58.620
Seems we couldn't settle the score with this contest.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.000
Dorothy?

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.700
Let's decide the winner on stage!

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:04.370
On stage...

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:08.130
Tension max! We won't accept defeat!

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.320
Sounds good to me.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:10.170
Yeah!

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:14.240
Aloha.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.190
You what?

00:17:16.190 --> 00:17:20.760
Set up a Pasta vs. Okonomiyaki Ultimate Showdown event?

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:25.310
Whatcha-monja? Showdown with Dressing Pafé? For real?

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:28.130
Mom, I'm going out for a bit.

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.140
To PriPara?

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:30.400
Huh?

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:38.530
Go on, go make some lovely friends, why don't you?

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:40.670
Yes!

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:12.590
This time it's our turn-pri!

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:16.650
Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.860
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:22.720
Coord Change Start!

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:28.230
New colors in the Pirates Coord line!

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:30.920
An autumn theme with eye-catching orange highlights.

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.500
Pirate Vivid Dress!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:42.470
The bright blue and yellow one is like made for Mireille!

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.510
Pirate Celeb Dress!

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:45.720
Pri!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:53.670
And Sophie is going with Holic Trick's classic gothic style in black and red.

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:55.900
Pirate Empress Dress!

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:56.040
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:59.260
Save us! Someone save us!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.300
Save us-pri!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:08.970
Liberation Maiden Valkyria!

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:13.140
Cyalume Change!

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:40.830
It's over!

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:43.910
The difference isn't huge, but it's a SoLaMi SMILE victory!

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.640
Truly like destined rivals!

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:54.100
We really can't afford to take our eyes off these two!

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:03.500
You bunch sure are stubborn.

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:08.370
But just you wait, one of these days we'll beat you for good, on stage and in business!

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:10.260
I'm not admitting defeat either.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.300
I won't admit defeat, but... here.

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:14.120
Eh?

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:19.540
Dorothy, Leona: welcome to our shopping district!

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:21.840
Thanks!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:25.970
You too, Dorothy!

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:31.320
I'm only trading with Leona!

00:23:06.380 --> 00:23:08.160
SoLaMi SMILE is in top form!

00:23:08.160 --> 00:23:09.530
As befits Lady Sophie!

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:12.240
And your image change is working out great-chanko!

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.690
Sophie is trying to take flight on her own.

00:23:15.690 --> 00:23:18.310
We must take action to support that decision!

00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:20.330
Sad though it is, we must bid you farewell-chanko.

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:22.460
Where will you go?

00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:24.170
What do you mean farewell?

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:25.250
We will...

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:27.070
Return to civilian life!

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:28.130
Chanko!

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:31.560
Next time: Break-up!? Lady Sophie's Royal Guard
